{"id": "5a729e7b5542992359bc313d", "question": "Which river system in Chilhowie, Virginia was the starting place for most Longhunters?", "answer": "The Holston River system's valley near Chilhowie, Virginia, was the starting place for most Longhunters. The Holston River flows through southwestern Virginia, and its forks (North Fork, Middle Fork, and South Fork) comprise the major river system. The document explicitly states that 'most long hunts started in the holston river valley near chilhowie, virginia.'", "gold_answer": "Holston River", "wallclock_seconds": 69.5878, "trajectory": {"question": "Which river system in Chilhowie, Virginia was the starting place for most Longhunters?", "strategic_plan": {"reasoning": "Strategic decomposition completed", "sub_questions": [{"step_id": 1, "sub_question": "What river systems are located in Chilhowie, Virginia?", "goal": "Collect information for: What river systems are located in Chilhowie, Virginia?", "dependencies": [], "expected_info_type": "general"}, {"step_id": 2, "sub_question": "Which of [river systems from step 1] was the starting place for most Longhunters?", "goal": "Collect information for: Which of [river systems from step 1] was the starting place for most Longhunters?", "dependencies": [1], "expected_info_type": "general"}]}, "execution_traces": [{"timestamp": "2026-04-19T18:26:48.904750", "agent_role": "PLAN", "input_data": {"question": "Which river system in Chilhowie, Virginia was the starting place for most Longhunters?"}, "output_data": {"raw_response": "[\n  {\n    \"subgoal_id\": 1,\n    \"subgoal\": \"What river systems are located in Chilhowie, Virginia?\",\n    \"dependencies\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"subgoal_id\": 2,\n    \"subgoal\": \"Which of [river systems from step 1] was the starting place for most Longhunters?\",\n    \"dependencies\": [1]\n  }\n]", "parsed_plan": {"reasoning": "Strategic decomposition completed", "sub_questions": [{"step_id": 1, "sub_question": "What river systems are locat