{"id": "5a79f6ca554299029c4b5f90", "question": "What Danish eurodance group had a single called \"Barbie Girl\" which resulted in a lawsuit in 2002?", "answer": "Yes, Aqua faced a lawsuit in 2002 related to their 1997 song 'Barbie Girl'. The case, Mattel v. MCA Records (296 F.3d 894, 9th Cir. 2002), involved a dispute over the song's use of the 'Barbie' trademark and was ultimately dismissed.", "gold_answer": "Aqua", "wallclock_seconds": 71.3016, "trajectory": {"question": "What Danish eurodance group had a single called \"Barbie Girl\" which resulted in a lawsuit in 2002?", "strategic_plan": {"reasoning": "Strategic decomposition completed", "sub_questions": [{"step_id": 1, "sub_question": "What is the name of the group that released the single 'Barbie Girl'?", "goal": "Collect information for: What is the name of the group that released the single 'Barbie Girl'?", "dependencies": [], "expected_info_type": "general"}, {"step_id": 2, "sub_question": "Did [entity from step 1] face a lawsuit in 2002?", "goal": "Collect information for: Did [entity from step 1] face a lawsuit in 2002?", "dependencies": [1], "expected_info_type": "general"}]}, "execution_traces": [{"timestamp": "2026-04-19T18:41:37.992980", "agent_role": "PLAN", "input_data": {"question": "What Danish eurodance group had a single called \"Barbie Girl\" which resulted in a lawsuit in 2002?"}, "output_data": {"raw_response": "[\n  {\n    \"subgoal_id\": 1,\n    \"subgoal\": \"What is the name of the group that released the single 'Barbie Girl'?\",\n    \"dependencies\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"subgoal_id\": 2,\n    \"subgoal\": \"Did [entity from step 1] face a lawsuit in 2002?\",\n    \"dependencies\": [1]\n  }\n]", "parsed_plan": {"reasoning": "Strategic decomposition completed", "sub_questions": [{"step_id": 1, "sub_question": "What is the name of the group that released the single 'Barbie Girl'?", "goal": "Collect information for: What is the name of the group that released the single 'Barbie Girl'?", "d