\": \"Documents [1] and [2] explicitly mention the 2002 lawsuit between Mattel and MCA Records tied to Aqua's 'Barbie Girl' song. The case is directly linked to Aqua's work and confirms the lawsuit occurred in 2002.\"\n}", "parsed_result": {"status": "yes", "answer": "Yes, Aqua faced a lawsuit in 2002 related to their 1997 song 'Barbie Girl'. The case, Mattel v. MCA Records (296 F.3d 894, 9th Cir. 2002), involved a dispute over the song's use of the 'Barbie' trademark and was ultimately dismissed.", "analysis": "Documents [1] and [2] explicitly mention the 2002 lawsuit between Mattel and MCA Records tied to Aqua's 'Barbie Girl' song. The case is directly linked to Aqua's work and confirms the lawsuit occurred in 2002."}}, "reasoning_process": "Analyzing documents for: Did Aqua face a lawsuit in 2002?", "retrieval_info": null, "success": true}], "final_answer": "Yes, Aqua faced a lawsuit in 2002 related to their 1997 song 'Barbie Girl'. The case, Mattel v. MCA Records (296 F.3d 894, 9th Cir. 2002), involved a dispute over the song's use of the 'Barbie' trademark and was ultimately dismissed.", "total_time": 71.30137181282043, "retrieval_rounds": 2}, "question_id": "5a79f6ca554299029c4b5f90", "prompt_tokens": 12168, "completion_tokens": 2742, "total_tokens": 14910, "llm_call_count": 3, "total_llm_latency_seconds": 71.1541, "mean_llm_call_latency_seconds": 23.718}
