e, which inspired 'Jeder Rappen z\u00e4hlt,' was begun in 2004 by Dutch radio station 3fm. This directly answers the sub-question about the origin year of the project.\"\n}", "parsed_result": {"status": "yes", "answer": "2004", "analysis": "The retrieved documents explicitly state that the 'serious request' initiative, which inspired 'Jeder Rappen z\u00e4hlt,' was begun in 2004 by Dutch radio station 3fm. This directly answers the sub-question about the origin year of the project."}}, "reasoning_process": "Analyzing documents for: In what year did The project that inspired Jeder Rappen z\u00e4hlt is the 'serious request' initiative, a multi-day multimedia fundraising event for international Red Cross initiatives originated by Dutch radio station 3fm in 2004. begin?", "retrieval_info": null, "success": true}], "final_answer": "2004", "total_time": 33.01924467086792, "retrieval_rounds": 2}, "question_id": "5ab2ce27554299545a2cfa98", "prompt_tokens": 11982, "completion_tokens": 1209, "total_tokens": 13191, "llm_call_count": 3, "total_llm_latency_seconds": 32.8755, "mean_llm_call_latency_seconds": 10.9585}
