{"id": "5ac290e85542992f1f2b3916", "question": "What facility is shared by RAAF Base Williamtown and Newcastle Airport in New South Wales?", "answer": "Yes, RAAF Base Williamtown includes the shared runway with Newcastle Airport, Fighter World aviation museum, Eastern Region Operations Centre (EROC) for surveillance and air battle management, and headquarters for key RAAF units like the Air Combat Group and Surveillance and Response Group. It hosts squadrons such as No. 26 Squadron (RAAF Reserve), No. 3 Control and Reporting Unit (3Cru), and No. 81 Wing operating F/A-18 Hornets. Newcastle Airport is located near the base and shares its runway facilities.", "gold_answer": "runway", "wallclock_seconds": 45.8219, "trajectory": {"question": "What facility is shared by RAAF Base Williamtown and Newcastle Airport in New South Wales?", "strategic_plan": {"reasoning": "Strategic decomposition completed", "sub_questions": [{"step_id": 1, "sub_question": "What are the facilities at RAAF Base Williamtown?", "goal": "Collect information for: What are the facilities at RAAF Base Williamtown?", "dependencies": [], "expected_info_type": "general"}, {"step_id": 2, "sub_question": "Which [facility from step 1] is also present at Newcastle Airport?", "goal": "Collect information for: Which [facility from step 1] is also present at Newcastle Airport?", "dependencies": [1], "expected_info_type": "general"}]}, "execution_traces": [{"timestamp": "2026-04-19T22:31:34.069497", "agent_role": "PLAN", "input_data": {"question": "What facility is shared by RAAF Base Williamtown and Newcastle Airport in New South Wales?"}, "output_data": {"raw_response": "[\n  {\n    \"subgoal_id\": 1,\n    \"subgoal\": \"What are the facilities at RAAF Base Williamtown?\",\n    \"dependencies\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"subgoal_id\": 2, \n    \"subgoal\": \"Which [facility from step 1] is also present at Newcastle Airport?\",\n    \"dependencies\": [1]\n  }\n]", "parsed_plan": {"reasoning": "Strategic decompositio